            "review_title": "Review at Chilli Thai - Aeon Mall Tan Phu",
            "review_text": "Đinh Thị Cẩm Tươi\nKien Giang Province, Vietnam5 contributions\n0\nExperience Thai cuisine in Vietnam\nOct 2025 • Family\nExperience at Chilli Thai beyond my expectations! \nFrom space, to items, everything has been decorated and invested carefully. \nThe dishes are beautifully served, rich in flavor, suitable for local people.\nThe service is great. The staff were very knowledgeable and did very well when advising us from the level of spicy, to any allergies. The staff is very useful and good notes. \nI appreciate Tom Yum soup and Tom Yum fried rice!\nRead more\nWritten October 5, 2025",
